('VERBS.pdf', 'idiom', 'After All', null, null, null, 'DESPUÉS DE TODO', 'Considering the fact that something happened or happens, something that is usually assumed', '“You don’t need to phone him. After all, he never phones you.”', null, null, 'AFTER ALL - DESPUÉS DE TODO'),
