('VERBS.pdf', 'idiom', 'Do (Something)', null, null, null, 'DEPENDE DE', 'To be responsible to choose or decide something', 'It is up to the company president to decide when the meeting will start.', null, 25, 'DO (SOMETHING) - DEPENDE DE'),
